  "outcome": "action_taken",
  "severity": "routine",
  "summary": "The landlord approved the garden works and is using their own contractor, Freya at Riverside Services, who is paid directly by the landlord. The job is waiting for confirmation that the work is complete. The tenant, the contractor and the landlord have each been messaged, the job is on hold with a review date of 2025-12-15, and the case will close without payment once completion is confirmed.",
