    },
    {
      "question": "2. What is the next action, who is it for, and through which channel?",
      "answer": "Email Freya (contractor) asking for completion date, tree-work status and invoice addressee (A4). Email the landlord (Leo Ashford) asking for completion confirmation and tree-work approval (A3). Email the tenant (Henry) with a status update (A2). Hold until 2025-12-15 and chase then (A6)."
